;; net-powerup's own idle and wait-respawn defstates for real. The single
;; leading space on each (defstate ...) line below is deliberate:
;; scripts/check_state_inherit.py's own goal_src scan is a line-anchored
;; regex with no comment-stripping, so a #| |# wrap alone does not hide a
;; :virtual #t defstate from it; indenting off column 0 does, without
